### Normalized scores (1–100)

Not computed — per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` SELF-EXCLUSION, a folder with zero verified public benchmark numbers must not carry a scored report; placeholder scores would corrupt the average. Saved as `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores inside are ignored by `pnpm sync`). If OpenAI announces GPT-6.2 Sol with published benchmarks, this file can be replaced by a fresh scored report.

